  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(25² + 16² - 18² - 4² + √(4²) - √121) = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(25² + 16² - 18² - 4² + √(4²) - √121) = ?\n\nCalculate powers and roots:\n\n⇒ 25² = 625, 16² = 256, 18² = 324, 4² = 16, √(4²) = 4, √121 = 11\n\nSubstitute the values:\n\n⇒ (625 + 256 - 324 - 16 + 4 - 11) = ?\n\n⇒ (625 + 256 + 4) - 324 - 16 - 11 = ?\n\n⇒ 885 - (324 + 16 + 11) = ?\n\n⇒ 885 - 351 = ?\n\n⇒ ? = 534\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1) 534.**",
